songha: Here's what I've been carrying. Since we're up here. Since it's that kind of night.
songha: The page runs out this year. Five lines, and then there's no line.
songha: Everybody asks what's next. The younger ones. The staff. My own notebook. I have an answer for every year except the one I'm standing in.
